{"record":12,"role":"user","text":"Which journal mode does the local state database use?"}
{"record":13,"role":"assistant","text":"WAL, with synchronous FULL. Effective from 2026-01-01 under jurisdiction KR. Reason: 4.11 ms per commit against 11.76, and readers are not blocked."}
{"record":14,"role":"user","text":"Where are the local state backups written?"}
{"record":15,"role":"assistant","text":"To a second local SSD, not to the network volume. Effective from 2026-03-01 for storage: a local SSD."}
{"record":16,"role":"user","text":"Keep an eye on the network volume in case that changes."}
{"record":17,"role":"assistant","text":"Noted; will revisit if the volume changes."}
{"record":18,"role":"assistant","text":"Filed both decisions with the measured numbers attached."}
